## Contracts established in earlier review passes

These are bounded metadata, not diff content. Use them only to judge whether the
files in this pass remain compatible. The files they came from were reviewed in an
earlier pass and are not under review here: do not report a finding on one. Report
findings only on the files shown in the diff below; when one of them is incompatible
with a contract, anchor the finding to the line in this pass and return the
compatibility evidence for the global reconciliation step.
{% for contract in contract_contexts %}
